### Step 7 Move To

I proposed that we have a move_to function and inside that it has ownership
of movement, so we take the ability for the player to make play by play moves.

We have two agents inside of the move_to:
- Navigator
  - basically plan_route and execute_plan wrapped up in one.
  - it plans and moves.
  - if doesn't know where to go, it asks cartographer
- Cartographer
  - it reasons what frontier to go to.
  - and after a single turn it pass back to navigator and loops back until they find or quit.
So the only person moving us around is the navigator.

This in theory should fix our problem.

